{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`QTY`,`title`:`The Market Scales`,`titleVN`:`Chi\u1ebfc c\u00e2n \u1edf ch\u1ee3`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Sen`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 b\u00e9 12 tu\u1ed5i gi\u00fap m\u1eb9 b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3 \u1edf ch\u1ee3, gi\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ebfm, hay \u0111\u1ed1 m\u1eb9o`},{`name`:`Mrs Hue`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7, 41 tu\u1ed5i, m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Sen, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3 th\u1eadt th\u00e0`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:3,`parts`:3,`title`:`Tom Is Rich`,`titleVN`:`Tom gi\u00e0u to`,`words`:`thirty|forty|fifty|sixty|seventy|eighty|ninety|hundred|thousand|million|metre|kilometre|mile|many|much|more|most|some`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[It]] [[is|be]] Tom, [[the]] English [[student]]. [[He]] [[has|have]] [[two]] [[million]] [[in]] [[his]] [[hand]]. \`[[In]] England, [[I]] [[have]] [[a]] [[few]] [[pounds|pound]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[In]] Hanoi, [[I]] [[have]] [[two]] [[million]]. [[I]] [[am|be]] [[rich]]!\` Sen [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[Two]] [[million]] [[is|be]] [[about]] [[sixty]] [[pounds|pound]], Tom.\``,`vn`:`\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 Tom, anh sinh vi\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi Anh. Anh c\u1ea7m hai tri\u1ec7u tr\u00ean tay. \`\u1ede Anh, anh ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 v\u00e0i b\u1ea3ng,\` anh n\u00f3i. \`\u1ede H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i, anh c\u00f3 hai tri\u1ec7u. Anh gi\u00e0u r\u1ed3i!\` Sen b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Hai tri\u1ec7u ch\u1ec9 kho\u1ea3ng s\u00e1u m\u01b0\u01a1i b\u1ea3ng th\u00f4i anh Tom \u1ea1.\``},{`en`:`Tom [[is|be]] [[hungry]], [[as]] [[always]]. \`[[How]] [[much]] [[are|be]] [[the]] [[bananas|banana]]?\` \`[[Thirty]] [[thousand]] [[a]] kilo.\` \`[[And]] [[the]] [[oranges|orange]]?\` \`[[Forty]].\` \`[[And]] [[the]] [[apples|apple]]?\` \`[[Seventy]].\` \`[[Brilliant]]! [[I]] [[want]] [[some]] [[of]] [[each]].\` \`[[How]] [[many]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Sen. \`[[Many]]!\` [[says|say]] Tom.`,`vn`:`Tom l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u0111\u00f3i. \`Chu\u1ed1i bao nhi\u00eau ti\u1ec1n m\u1ed9t c\u00e2n em?\` \`Ba m\u01b0\u01a1i ngh\u00ecn m\u1ed9t c\u00e2n \u1ea1.\` \`C\u00f2n cam?\` \`B\u1ed1n m\u01b0\u01a1i.\` \`C\u00f2n t\u00e1o?\` \`B\u1ea3y m\u01b0\u01a1i.\` \`Tuy\u1ec7t! Anh l\u1ea5y m\u1ed7i th\u1ee9 m\u1ed9t \u00edt.\` \`Bao nhi\u00eau \u1ea1?\` Sen h\u1ecfi. \`Th\u1eadt nhi\u1ec1u!\` Tom \u0111\u00e1p.`},{`en`:`[[He]] [[eats|eat]] [[most]] [[of]] [[the]] [[bananas|banana]] [[at]] [[the]] [[table]]. \`[[You]] [[eat]] [[a]] [[lot]], Tom,\` [[says|say]] Mrs Hue. \`[[I]] [[run]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[too]]!\` [[says|say]] Tom. \`[[In]] England, [[I]] [[run]] [[three]] [[miles|mile]] [[every]] [[morning]]. [[Here]], [[I]] [[run]] [[five]] [[kilometres|kilometre]]. [[Then]] [[I]] [[run]] [[from]] [[my]] [[room]] [[to]] [[the]] [[market]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[eight]] [[hundred]] [[metres|metre]].\``,`vn`:`Anh \u0103n g\u1ea7n h\u1ebft ch\u1ed7 chu\u1ed1i ngay t\u1ea1i s\u1ea1p. \`Ch\u00e1u \u0103n kh\u1ecfe th\u1eadt \u0111\u1ea5y, Tom,\` c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 n\u00f3i. \`Ch\u00e1u ch\u1ea1y c\u0169ng nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0 c\u00f4!\` Tom n\u00f3i. \`\u1ede Anh, s\u00e1ng n\u00e0o ch\u00e1u c\u0169ng ch\u1ea1y ba d\u1eb7m. \u1ede \u0111\u00e2y, ch\u00e1u ch\u1ea1y n\u0103m c\u00e2y s\u1ed1. R\u1ed3i ch\u00e1u ch\u1ea1y t\u1eeb ph\u00f2ng tr\u1ecd ra ch\u1ee3. T\u00e1m tr\u0103m m\u00e9t \u0111\u1ea5y \u1ea1.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Which]] [[is|be]] [[more]], [[three]] [[miles|mile]] [[or]] [[five]] [[kilometres|kilometre]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Sen. Tom [[does|do]] [[not]] [[know]]. \`[[They]] [[are|be]] [[about]] [[the]] [[same]],\` [[says|say]] Sen. \`[[Five]] [[kilometres|kilometre]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[little]] [[more]] [[than]] [[three]] [[miles|mile]].\``,`vn`:`\`Ba d\u1eb7m v\u1edbi n\u0103m c\u00e2y s\u1ed1, c\u00e1i n\u00e0o d\u00e0i h\u01a1n \u1ea1?\` Sen h\u1ecfi. Tom ch\u1ecbu kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft. \`G\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 b\u1eb1ng nhau,\` Sen n\u00f3i. \`N\u0103m c\u00e2y s\u1ed1 d\u00e0i h\u01a1n ba d\u1eb7m m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat.\``},{`en`:`Sen [[adds|add]] [[the]] [[money]]. \`[[Three]] kilos [[of]] [[bananas|banana]] [[is|be]] [[ninety]]. [[Two]] kilos [[of]] [[oranges|orange]] [[is|be]] [[eighty]]. [[One]] kilo [[of]] [[apples|apple]] [[is|be]] [[seventy]]. [[That]] [[is|be]] [[two]] [[hundred]] [[and]] [[forty]] [[thousand]].\` Tom [[gives|give]] [[her]] [[some]] [[money]] [[and]] [[runs|run]] [[off]] [[with]] [[his]] [[bags|bag]].`,`vn`:`Sen c\u1ed9ng ti\u1ec1n. \`Ba c\u00e2n chu\u1ed1i l\u00e0 ch\u00edn m\u01b0\u01a1i. Hai c\u00e2n cam l\u00e0 t\u00e1m m\u01b0\u01a1i. M\u1ed9t c\u00e2n t\u00e1o l\u00e0 b\u1ea3y m\u01b0\u01a1i. T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 l\u00e0 hai tr\u0103m b\u1ed1n m\u01b0\u01a1i ngh\u00ecn.\` Tom \u0111\u01b0a ti\u1ec1n cho c\u00f4 b\u00e9 r\u1ed3i x\u00e1ch t\u00fai ch\u1ea1y bi\u1ebfn.`},{`en`:`Sen [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[money]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[two]] [[hundred]] [[and]] [[forty]] [[thousand]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[one]] [[million]]! \`Tom!\` [[she]] [[shouts|shout]]. [[But]] Tom [[is|be]] [[fifty]] [[metres|metre]] [[away]], [[and]] [[he]] [[is|be]] [[very]] [[fast]].`,`vn`:`Sen nh\u00ecn s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n. Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i hai tr\u0103m b\u1ed1n m\u01b0\u01a1i ngh\u00ecn. M\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t tri\u1ec7u! \`Anh Tom!\` c\u00f4 b\u00e9 h\u00e9t l\u00ean. Nh\u01b0ng Tom \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ea1y xa n\u0103m m\u01b0\u01a1i m\u00e9t, m\u00e0 anh l\u1ea1i ch\u1ea1y r\u1ea5t nhanh.`}],`tease`:`Sen c\u00f3 \u0111u\u1ed5i k\u1ecbp Tom \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i ti\u1ec1n th\u1eeba kh\u00f4ng?`}]}